      ],
      "image": "assets/images/23176/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Blend sour cream and taco seasoning in a small bowl until combined. Set aside.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/nr1AOxBLohjI8nAGnpG9iL_23i4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/23176-seven-layer-dip-step-03-DDMFS-c1051600434748f28ddd3e87f7bc7483.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/23176/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Spread refried beans in a 9x13-inch dish or on a large serving platter. Top with sour cream mixture; cover with guacamole. Top with tomatoes, green onions, Mexican-style cheese blend, and black olives.",
